:{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""},{"length":345,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}],"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":413,"ty":4809}}},"id":"105a33b4-8923-4ef7-81a0-f97c4a0e5eb5","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-1273.03515625,"ty":-6891},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":867},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":25,"x":0,"style":{"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Bold","family":"Roboto","style":"Bold"}}},{"y":15,"from":25,"to":120}],[{"y":39,"from":120,"to":234,"x":0}],[{"y":63,"from":234,"to":346,"x":0}],[{"y":87,"from":346,"to":370,"x":0}]]}],"rawText":"Trauma craneoencefálico: corresponde a una lesión en la cabeza que puede afectar el cerebro y alterar el estado general de la niña o el niño. Por ejemplo, después de una caída desde una cama, si presenta vómito repetido, somnolencia, convulsiones o cambios en el comportamiento, se deben evitar movimientos bruscos, vigilar su estado y solicitar atención especializada. "}},{"type":"text","name":"Movilización de emergencia: se realiza cuando permanecer en el lugar representa un riesgo mayor que mover a la niña o al niño. Por ejemplo, si ocurre un incendio o una fuga de gas en la vivienda, se debe trasladar a un sitio seguro, protegiendo cabeza, cue","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintWidth":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":28,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Bold","postscriptName":"Roboto-Bold","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""},{"length":268,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}],"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":413,"ty":5749}}},"id":"2c5ef4f7-48ae-45dc-9ca0-b17c1a0c447c","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-1273.03515625,"ty":-5951},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":867},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":28,"x":0,"style":{"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Bold","family":"Roboto","style":"Bold"}}},{"y":15,"from":28,"to":118}],[{"y":39,"from":118,"to":233,"x":0}],[{"y":63,"from":233,"to":296,"x":0}]]}],"rawText":"Movilización de emergencia: se realiza cuando permanecer en el lugar representa un riesgo mayor que mover a la niña o al niño. Por ejemplo, si ocurre un incendio o una fuga de gas en la vivienda, se debe trasladar a un sitio seguro, protegiendo cabeza, cuello y cuerpo durante el desplazamiento. "}},{"type":"text","name":"Trauma cervical: corresponde a una lesión que puede comprometer las estructuras del cuello y la parte superior de la columna vertebral. Por ejemplo, si después de una caída la niña o el niño manifiesta dolor cervical, dificultad para mover el cuello, debil","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintWidth":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":17,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Bold","postscriptName":"Roboto-Bold","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""},{"length":373,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}],"localTransform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":413,"ty":4959}}},"id":"d30c5812-96a2-4f23-8e8a-b559db0e3c98","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-1273.03515625,"ty":-6741},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":867},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":17,"x":0,"style":{"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Bold","family":"Roboto","style":"Bold"}}},{"y":15,"from":17,"to":117}],[{"y":39,"from":117,"to":240,"x":0}],[{"y":63,"from":240,"to":360,"x":0}],[{"y":87,"from":360,"to":390,"x":0}]]}],"rawText":"Trauma cervical: corresponde a una lesión que puede comprometer las estructuras del cuello y la parte superior de la columna vertebral. Por ejemplo, si después de una caída la niña o el niño manifiesta dolor cervical, dificultad para mover el cuello, debilidad o pérdida de sensibilidad, se debe mantener la cabeza inmóvil y solicitar ayuda especializada, sin intentar cambiar su posición. "}},{"type":"text","name":"Movilización no urgente: se efectúa cuando el entorno es seguro y no existe amenaza inmediata. Por ejemplo, si una niña cae mientras juega en la sala y presenta dolor en una pierna, se debe evitar moverla, inmovilizar la zona, acompañarla y esperar la lleg","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintWidth":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":24,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Bold","postscriptName":"Roboto-Bold","fontSize"